WEBVTT

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:07.130
Jeez!

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.430
What's that black forest fairy's problem?!

00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:16.690
Salodeah-san's been super 
mad ever since she met him!

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.330
The current princess couldn't do that.

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.640
A pupa like her simply can't.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.210
A pupa?

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:27.430
Argh!

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:33.670
That's right! I can't use the 
power of spring like my mother yet!

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:36.670
It's because I keep carrying 
this short sword around.

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:41.100
I have to foist it off on 
the healer and go home!

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.360
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:18.360
<b>The Tomboy Fairy and the Spring-Eating Dragon (Part 2)</b>

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:17.760
Looks like she's over her tantrum.

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:21.280
Yuu-san!

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:22.650
Wh-Who's there?

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:26.110
S-Sorry!

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:30.680
I love that flower pattern! It's gorgeous!

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:38.360
Is that...

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:40.730
the magic sword from the legend?

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:42.220
N-No...

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:47.470
But why does she have it?

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:48.440
<i>Crap.</i>

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:50.730
W-Well, you see...

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:52.580
<i>Th-This is bad.</i>

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:57.780
<i>If I'm not careful, they'll find out that 
I'm the one who spread the black fog!</i>

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:04.490
<i>And if I can't foist it off on him, I'll have 
to go to where the dragon is too, right?</i>

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:09.310
No way am I doing that!

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:10.970
What's gotten into her?

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:12.750
She's got a lot going on.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:18.260
<i>N-No, wait. If I have them 
all fight the dragon,</i>

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:23.890
<i>then I can just seal it away, I guess.</i>

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:26.750
<i>That'll solve everything!</i>

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:32.610
<i>Mom might start to respect me and tell 
me how to use the power of spring!</i>

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:33.640
Um...

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:36.990
Y-You're a master detective, Merc!

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:40.440
This is indeed the magic 
sword from the legend!

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:43.150
It was buried in the garden of 
the castle for some reason!

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:44.000
Wow!

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:49.780
And in order to perform my duty as a princess
 and seal it away, I snuck out of the castle!

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:52.990
That's just what I thought!

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:54.360
Right?

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:56.500
I guess the secret's out now, huh?

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:06.940
Looks like we'll have to take the 
long way around to the dragon.

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:13.460
But why was the fairy in the 
black forest so mean to us?

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:16.480
Once there was a fairy who 
committed a great crime,

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:20.200
and as punishment, lost the power to fly.

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:21.860
That's how the legend goes.

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:24.760
And they're said to be his descendants.

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:28.830
They've kept to that tradition and avoided any 
contact with outsiders for generations.

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:31.080
Tradition?

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:35.550
I guess humans are involved somehow.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:42.800
A heartless human caused great sorrow 
to their ancestor or something.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:46.340
Sorry, that's a weird thing to say.

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:48.940
But it's got nothing to do with you.

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:51.300
Y-Yeah...

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:55.860
You seem closer than you were before.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.260
I'm not friends with a Sugaroru!

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:01.100
I wouldn't want to be your friend, either!

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:04.830
Hey, why do they fight all the time?

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:07.540
Something about a generations-old feud.

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:13.100
I remember my butler talking about that.

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:16.240
But just forget about it, and be friends!

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:19.660
We're all traveling together,

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:23.300
and since you're both strong, if you 
work together, you'll be even stronger!

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:27.210
M-Monsters?!

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:29.780
Oh, no! They're coming straight at us!

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:31.950
H-Huh?

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:35.050
Everyone, over there!

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:36.970
The fog!

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:41.070
So that's it! Those monsters 
weren't trying to attack us,

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:43.580
they were fleeing from the fog!

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:44.470
It's coming!

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:49.310
Princess!

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:51.650
Ow...

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:53.100
This way!

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:57.450
The treasure sword of the Sugaroru!

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.250
Paristos-san!

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:10.000
Don't worry about me, just go!

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:12.080
We can't do that!

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:19.110
Get on. I'll explain later.

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:21.470
If you don't want the fog to 
swallow you up, then hurry!

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:33.490
How's that fairy doing?

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:35.780
Asleep, thanks to the medicine.

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:39.540
What happens if you touch that fog?

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:42.270
You lose the spring in your heart.

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:47.640
The ability to smile at the sunlight 
spilling through the trees,

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:49.090
or to find another beautiful.

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:51.560
You lose it all.

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:54.430
Just like those who live in the 
land where no flowers bloom.

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:02.890
U-Um, we didn't get your name yet.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:05.550
I'm Yuu.

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:07.550
I'm Merc!

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:10.060
Zephyrodai.

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:11.670
Zephyrodai-san...

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:14.880
Thank you for saving us.

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:17.240
But... why?

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:20.030
We do not follow the queen.

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:22.500
We have our own organization.

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.050
And that organization made its choice.

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:27.720
Not that I agree with it.

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:31.280
Just for tonight, you can sleep here.

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:32.350
Use the room as you like.

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:37.800
Blessings...

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:39.190
Flowers...

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:41.880
Open at my voice!

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:42.170
What are you doing?

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:46.040
Hey! Don't surprise me like that!

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:48.140
It's dark enough in here already!

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:54.410
Are you trying to heal that fairy 
with the power of blessings?

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:58.250
I have the same power as my mother!

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:01.030
S-So if I practice...

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:02.380
Impossible, for a pupa.

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:03.960
You said it again!

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.000
That short sword...

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.210
I won't ask where you got it.

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:11.640
But do you know about the spell on it?

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:14.660
It's not a spell to seal a dragon?

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:18.060
No. It's a spell to turn a dragon to stone.

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:18.760
A stone?

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:24.400
<i>So that stone really was the 
dragon that was sealed long ago.</i>

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:28.260
Well, it doesn't matter.

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:30.190
As long as the fog goes away...

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:32.330
Wh-What?

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:37.690
<i>You've spoiled her badly, Florayla.</i>

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:59.620
This is Hanging Bell Forest?

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:02.550
It's dark and creepy.

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:08.970
If I had grabbed my sword, 
he wouldn't have...

00:09:09.300 --> 00:09:11.550
There's nothing to worry about.

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:15.490
The fairies of the black forest 
are looking after him.

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:18.260
For now, just focus on going forward.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.270
Okay.

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:21.560
Thank you.

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:26.950
Hey, can't we fly?

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:29.850
Look carefully.

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:34.480
If you try to use your wings, 
you'll be trapped immediately.

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:38.450
And that's not the only thing 
that makes them terrifying.

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:40.850
It's their sheer numbers.

00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:44.840
Every grown spider has 
several hundred children.

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:48.090
That's too many!

00:09:50.010 --> 00:09:51.440
The air's changed.

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:52.670
Be careful.

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:07.790
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:11.280
Salodeah-san!

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.460
Huh?

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:15.580
Are you okay, Princess?

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:21.500
<i>It doesn't hurt anywhere.</i>

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:24.490
<i>But that big spider just attacked me...</i>

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:28.950
<i>The talisman!</i>

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:36.280
<i>Protective Stone, please keep the 
princess safe from all disasters!</i>

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:40.680
<i>Even if my wings never fly again,</i>

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:42.750
<i>please protect the princess!</i>

00:10:44.590 --> 00:10:47.490
That jewel had a spell on it.

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:50.720
What kind of spell?

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:53.130
One we can't use.

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:56.630
A spell empowered with deep love,

00:10:57.050 --> 00:11:01.010
and a willingness to sacrifice 
everything to protect someone.

00:11:02.630 --> 00:11:03.790
Is that a big spider?

00:11:05.650 --> 00:11:08.150
Be careful! We're surrounded!

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:11.560
Yuu-san!

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:21.350
That's it...

00:11:21.350 --> 00:11:25.240
The spiders are all 
protecting their children!

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:28.110
That's why they're attacking us now 
that we're in their territory!

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:36.020
Stay focused.

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:37.550
Or they'll grab your leg again.

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:39.550
R-Right!

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:41.750
They've totally surrounded us.

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:43.760
Looks like you're having a bad time!

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:49.450
They say the hero always 
shows up late, right?

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:51.220
Paristos!

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:53.770
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:00.840
Now! Let's get through the forest!

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:03.290
Merc!

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:04.130
Yuu-san!

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:16.250
We made it through the spiders' territory.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:18.500
How... did you...

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:23.510
Oh, the medicine means I 
can move around a little.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:26.910
The smoke bombs they gave 
me were a big help, too.

00:12:29.110 --> 00:12:30.250
Your Highness,

00:12:30.710 --> 00:12:35.730
I'm sorry I couldn't protect you back there.

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:37.530
Princess?

00:12:39.180 --> 00:12:42.780
It's broken. The pendant 
my butler gave me...

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:50.770
I always said it wasn't cute.

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:57.850
It's all in pieces now,

00:12:58.620 --> 00:13:00.410
and it's my fault!

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:03.040
I'm sorry!

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:05.930
It was all a lie!

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:08.110
The truth is...

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:12.600
I was just trying to make you do everything!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:13.800
Salodeah-san!

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:15.020
Because...

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:24.760
Because I'm the one who 
broke the dragon's seal!

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:25.700
Princess...

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:38.910
This is bad.

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:40.370
It's not—

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:44.340
It doesn't matter to the dragon 
or the fog if she's a kid or not.

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:47.580
Well, true, but...

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:48.730
So...

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:51.980
What will you do...

00:13:52.530 --> 00:13:55.210
If the princess says she wants to go home?

00:14:05.270 --> 00:14:09.700
Everyone, I'm sorry for lying to you all!

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:12.870
I'm going on ahead...

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:15.380
To the dragon.

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:19.740
I need to end this myself.

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:23.370
That's the only thing I can do.

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:25.410
Princess...

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:28.940
Princess... I'm sorry.

00:14:28.940 --> 00:14:33.480
It looks like I can't protect you anymore.

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:36.830
It's probably not just his right hand.

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:40.150
His whole body is being exposed 
to a raging blizzard.

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:41.300
No...

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:43.290
I'm really sorry.

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:47.620
No. You are the heir to the 
blood of the brave Garandol.

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:51.030
Thank you for coming this far.

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:52.860
Meneraiah!

00:14:52.860 --> 00:14:53.860
Yes?

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:55.390
I have a request.

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:58.500
Go back with Paristos.

00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:00.930
Protect him.

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:03.740
All right.

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:09.810
We'll make sure that on your way back, 
the spiders don't threaten you.

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:15.260
A Sugaroru swordmaster will 
be protecting the way home.

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:17.730
Nothing could make me feel safer!

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:19.390
But of course!

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:22.600
And with a brave Garandol by her side, too!

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:24.490
Go, Princess.

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:26.480
With the Sugaroru by my side,

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:29.120
even wounded, I can still 
defend your way home.

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:30.450
Thank you.

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:35.410
So what will you do?

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:37.900
What <i>can</i> I do?

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:43.170
Heal monsters with my magic, I guess?

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:45.590
I'm still not confident about it, though.

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:47.170
I see.

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:49.380
Let's hurry.

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:56.500
It's so cold.

00:15:56.500 --> 00:16:00.600
The queen's power no longer 
reaches here, it seems.

00:16:04.450 --> 00:16:09.920
The fetid spring where the dragon 
dwells is probably up ahead.

00:16:19.610 --> 00:16:20.690
What?

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:24.110
It's dark... I can't see anything.

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:26.910
And it's so cold.

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:29.560
Is this the black fog?

00:16:29.560 --> 00:16:31.500
Hello, Salodeah!

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:38.540
Yuu-san! Yuu-san!

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:41.500
You're awake?

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:42.690
Where's the princess?

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.430
She probably went on ahead.

00:16:45.430 --> 00:16:47.660
I'm glad you're safe.

00:16:47.660 --> 00:16:49.780
Thank the queen for that.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:55.960
It seems you avoided being 
hurt by the black fog,

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:59.130
but the fog formed a terrible foe, it seems.

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:05.410
Hey, Salodeah.

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:08.030
It's cold and dark in here, huh?

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:11.320
But somebody will take care of everything.

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:14.410
No, I have to stay here.

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:17.040
I have to do this!

00:17:19.690 --> 00:17:20.890
I see.

00:17:21.670 --> 00:17:25.060
Then you need to turn the dragon 
to stone, for everybody's sake.

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:26.520
Stone?

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:27.180
That's right!

00:17:27.720 --> 00:17:29.680
With this magic sword!

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:32.440
This thing is a shadow.

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:36.490
It's eaten so much spring,
 it can't control its own power.

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:39.350
A shadow? Then if I heal it...

00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:42.920
No, a shadow is just a 
portion of the real thing.

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:44.950
Its heart, you could say.

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:46.810
Its heart...

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:51.080
So if I heal it, that'll have 
an effect on the real one?

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:52.500
Probably.

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:54.630
I'll try it.

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:13.590
Now, let's go beat the bad dragon who eats 
spring and lock it away into a stone!

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:14.760
Come on!

00:18:23.860 --> 00:18:27.470
You were always alone?

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:33.660
You need to hurry before 
it eats everyone's spring.

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:35.660
No!

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:37.660
Then what will you do?

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:41.720
I'll ask the dragon to stop eating spring!

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:44.480
It'll just swallow you up.

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:47.480
Then I'll ask it from inside its belly!

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:50.890
I see.

00:18:52.590 --> 00:18:55.650
Then you won't need this anymore, will you?

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:03.580
Those wings are beautiful.

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:06.390
Bye!

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:24.430
You have sad eyes.

00:19:24.870 --> 00:19:27.440
Like midnight on a cold winter night.

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:31.000
Such a sad color.

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:37.760
You've been cold and alone 
for so long, haven't you?

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:39.680
I'm sorry.

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:43.050
But it's okay now.

00:19:43.580 --> 00:19:47.040
Spring will come for you, too.

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:03.140
This warmth...

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:04.740
It's the princess!

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:05.810
Yes.

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:09.450
She brought us spring.

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:15.420
So this is spring?

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:16.560
That's right.

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:18.600
Warm, isn't it?

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:20.700
Right, Frueling?

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:25.110
That means "spring," doesn't it?

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:35.410
Now that spring is here,
my business is a big success, jamo!

00:20:35.410 --> 00:20:37.950
Drinks are on me today!

00:20:39.970 --> 00:20:41.760
Gimme another!

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:44.980
Me, too!

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:46.080
Want to have a drinking contest?

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:47.180
Great idea!

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:47.960
More!

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:51.080
Those two...

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:55.030
They're close enough to squabble, huh?

00:20:57.060 --> 00:20:58.970
Sorry, Toto!

00:20:58.970 --> 00:21:01.730
You can't get in at your size!

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:07.030
It was all thanks to you.

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:11.720
I'm so glad you're safe.

00:21:13.220 --> 00:21:16.710
And that you have such beautiful wings.

00:21:17.060 --> 00:21:19.450
Why are you crying?

00:21:19.450 --> 00:21:22.880
You just cry a lot at my age.

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:25.960
You're so silly.

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:32.480
I never thought I'd see the day 
when you visited Spring Hill.

00:21:32.480 --> 00:21:36.980
Spring made me feel like it.

00:21:37.970 --> 00:21:42.050
I think I'm better at making 
it than I was 20 years ago.

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:44.590
How about some honey tea?

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:46.900
I'll take it.

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:26.890
It's me, Titi!

00:23:26.890 --> 00:23:27.730
It's me, Chacha!

00:23:27.730 --> 00:23:30.000
I want some honey tea!

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:31.990
It's perfect for this time of year!

00:23:31.990 --> 00:23:34.520
We should suggest it to the game's admins!

00:23:34.520 --> 00:23:38.150
Next time: "The Red Star of Evil and the 
Brilliant Ruler of Superior Flame"!

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>The Red Star of Evil and the Brilliant Ruler of Superior Flame</b>

00:23:38.140 --> 00:23:40.200
Look forward to it!
